  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">International Finance Corporation Fiji Private Sector Development Partnership Phase II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The DFAT-IFC Fiji Private Sector Partnership Phase II supports the work of the IFC in Fiji. Building on a previous partnership, this phase focuses on support to the IFC to create concrete opportunities for inclusive, sustainable private investment in support of COVID-19 recovery and medium-term economic growth through targeted advisory interventions.  Interventions focus on the tourism, infrastructure, agriculture, and financial sectors. The Partnership seeks to lock in resilient, gender and climate-smart private sector development into Fiji&#x2019;s long term development trajectory.</narrative>
  </description>
